date-released: "2026-11-06"
abstract: "The research data behind the HASH$CyberAxe library: 1,227,001 typed scientific cell records, the historical experiment tables, the exact-source bundles, the library's machine indexes and the readable field guides. This repository holds the schemas, manifests, a verifier and a cell reader; the large archives are attached to its Release. Use it to analyse the data yourself, check a result against its saved records, or build on the cell format."
keywords:
  - cryptanalysis
  - SHA-256
  - BLAKE3
  - SHA-3
  - Poseidon
  - reproducibility
